    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale In One or More Lots\nA unique and rare opportunity to acquire a substantial residential and agricultural holding extending to approximately 16.80 acres, superbly situated at the foot of Keash Hill. The property comprises a detached four bedroom bungalow constructed in the 1980s (C Rating), a separate original three-bedroom, two-storey residence dating from the early 1900s (G Rating), together with an extensive range of traditional and modern farm buildings, all set on lands of excellent agricultural quality. Both residential properties have been unoccupied for a number of years and may qualify for the vacant property refurbishment grant and the derelict property grant, subject to the relevant terms and approval of Sligo County Council. The property is offered for sale in its entirety or in the following lots, presenting an outstanding opportunity for farmers, investors, or purchasers seeking a residential holding with exceptional potential.\n\nLot 1 Knockoconor Kesh,\nComprising a detached four bedroom bungalow, a separate original three bedroom two storey residence, an extensive range of farm buildings and yard, all situated on circa 6 acres of excellent quality agricultural land with substantial road frontage. The property benefits from mains electricity, water supply and a septic tank, with all services located on site.\nPrice Region 395,000.00 euros\n\nLot 2 Knockoconor Keash,\nCirca 4.15 acres of excellent quality agricultural land with the benefit of extensive road frontage onto two public roads, providing excellent accessibility together with future potential, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\nPrice region 50,000.00 euros\n\nLot 3 Binganagh, Keash,\nCirca 5.93 acres of elevated, high quality agricultural land with good road frontage and direct access onto a public road. The lands are laid out in well defined divisions and are suitable for a wide range of agricultural enterprises.\nPrice Region 50,000.00 euros SALE AGREED \n\nThis is a truly exceptional opportunity to acquire a versatile residential farm in a highly sought after location with significant residential, agricultural and investment potential.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment.\n\nServices \nwater \nSeptic tank\n"
      },
      {
